    "value_statement": "Manual releases can miss changelog, version, and tag steps. This skill guides a repeatable release workflow for baoyu-skills with bilingual changelogs and local git tagging.",
    "seo_keywords": [
      "Claude",
      "Codex",
      "Claude Code",
